    "description": "Manam antha dhentlo aina siddhahasthulam ante adhi negativity ni theesukovatam lone. Negativity ki malle poolu petti alankarinchi dhannam pettukuntam. 18 years ki vote yeyyachu, 21 years ki mandhu thaagachu ani telusukune manaki, kusantha sepu mana samasyalaki samayam idham ani matram anukomu, telusukomu.⁣\n⁣\nAntha endhuku, pelli kosam, vandha abaddhaalu aadachchu ani telusukuntam, kani mana kaaranalu manalni mingesthunayo ledho ani telusukune burra matram ledhu ani yedusthaam. Endhukayya Rahul ee paniki malina muchatlu?⁣\n⁣\nSollu chepthunanu ani anukokapothe, oo gantalu gantalu arugu meedha kurchoni 'Bahubali lo bhalla em chesedu, avengers aaviri endhuku ipoyero' ani science ke ardham kani discussionlu pette manaki, kurchoni correct ga manaki unnavi asalu paniki raani kaaranalu kaava ani kanipettalema? ⁣\n⁣\n\"Neyema nammukunna dhaani meedha opportunity rakapothe, odhileyaka em cheyali bey mari?\" ani aristhe matram, opportunity rakapothe aapey mani rajyaangam lo raasi ledhu, ala ani Rashi Khanna kuda cheppa ledhu. Avakasam ravatledhu ani avesapadatam nee hakku ani ela urroothalu ooguthavo, alisipoyentha kashtapadatam kuda nee badhyathe ani telusuko.⁣\n⁣\nOpportunity ravali ante opika pattali ani chepthe guu lo kaludhi kani adhe nijam, God promise. Avakasam eppudu, ela osthundho cheppalem. Arjunudiki, Geethopadesham gurinchi Mahabaratam madyalo telisindhi. Prophet Muhammad ki Qur'an ni vinataniki 23 years pattindhi. Bible rayataniki 1300+ years kavalsochindhi. ⁣\n⁣\nIkada nuvu telusukovalsina neethi edaina undhi ante \"annitiki oka time anedhi yedhusthadhi\" ani. Kevalam nuvu anukundi jaragatledhu kabatti kindha padi dorli kottesukunte avakasam ocheyadhu. Ala ochedhi, corona la ekkuva rojulu undadu. ⁣\n⁣\nIdhigo balraju, nuvu genuine ga try chesi unte, I respect you. But chala sarlu, manam kaaranalu vethukuntam odhileyataniki. Endhukante repo maapo naalanti dharina poye dhaanayya ninnu chusi navvithe, kalakattha kalakand lanti kaaranalu meedhaki thoseyataniki. Prathi manishi puttetapudu kashtapadakundane kusantha mariyadha sampadinchukuntadu. Adhi daya chesi paniki raani kaaranalatho sampeskoku.⁣\n⁣\n*𝘊𝘰𝘯𝘵𝘪𝘯𝘶𝘦𝘥 𝘪𝘯 𝘤𝘰𝘮𝘮𝘦𝘯𝘵 𝘴𝘦𝘤𝘵𝘪𝘰𝘯*⁣",
